<title>NETHERLANDS: Amsterdamdam Exchange suspends Fokker trade.</title>
<headline>Amsterdamdam Exchange suspends Fokker trade.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The trade supervisor of the Amsterdam Stock Exchange said on Thursday all trade in shares of bankrupt aircraft maker Fokker was suspended until further notice.</p>
<p>The measure was taken in connection with an expected statement, the exchange added in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
